WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.084 --> 00:00:11.417
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:14.284
- I think I had the most
style when I was a little kid,

00:00:14.284 --> 00:00:17.677
and my mom was dressing
me, because I was so cute.

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:19.849
Everything was, like,
nineties and colorful

00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:22.176
and that is, like, back in now.

00:00:22.176 --> 00:00:23.733
- I wouldn't really say I had style

00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:25.930
when I was in lower grade school.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:27.909
I don't really think in
kindergarten or first grade

00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:30.069
I really knew what I was wearing,

00:00:30.069 --> 00:00:32.807
I think that mostly my
mom picked out my clothes

00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:35.362
and it had a lot of cartoon characters

00:00:35.362 --> 00:00:37.665
and little, cute, matching
skirts and dresses,

00:00:37.665 --> 00:00:40.251
type of style, is what I wore.

00:00:40.251 --> 00:00:43.095
- Right when I started
transitioning into my preteen years,

00:00:43.095 --> 00:00:46.095
that's when things kinda
got a little rough.

00:00:46.095 --> 00:00:50.861
In the picture, at that age, I
(sighs)

00:00:50.861 --> 00:00:53.914
I don't think it was very stylish.

00:00:53.914 --> 00:00:58.817
I had these pair of boots
and they were my lucky boots,

00:00:58.817 --> 00:01:00.614
I would wear them everywhere I went.

00:01:00.614 --> 00:01:02.083
I would wear them with every outfit,

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.702
even though it didn't match.

00:01:03.702 --> 00:01:07.869
But I felt like my most true
self in them, at the time.

00:01:08.923 --> 00:01:11.872
- I could remember my mom
taking me to Limited Too

00:01:11.872 --> 00:01:15.196
for my first-day-of-school outfit

00:01:15.196 --> 00:01:17.626
and me being so excited to pick it out

00:01:17.626 --> 00:01:20.386
and the cute, little flowy
skirt with the matching top.

00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:22.512
It was just like, being in that store

00:01:22.512 --> 00:01:23.968
was such a great feeling

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:25.557
and it meant school was about to start.

00:01:25.557 --> 00:01:27.908
(jaunty music)
- I'm trying to find

00:01:27.908 --> 00:01:30.789
this outfit that I wore on
the first day of kindergarten.

00:01:30.789 --> 00:01:33.628
- This is what I looked like.

00:01:33.628 --> 00:01:35.844
- I think we should probably
try to find the jumper.

00:01:35.844 --> 00:01:37.804
- As you can see, I had the camo shirt

00:01:37.804 --> 00:01:40.603
with the white long-sleeve underneath, but

00:01:40.603 --> 00:01:41.900
they were connected.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:44.067
- Let's go try to find it.

00:01:46.681 --> 00:01:49.773
This might work. That might work.

00:01:49.773 --> 00:01:51.273
If it's button-up.

00:01:52.895 --> 00:01:53.919
I think that one could work.

00:01:53.919 --> 00:01:55.412
- I think this one would
be a good undershirt

00:01:55.412 --> 00:01:57.528
to go under my camo shirt.

00:01:57.528 --> 00:01:58.591
- I think this could work.

00:01:58.591 --> 00:02:01.989
I think that's probably as
close as you're gonna get.

00:02:01.989 --> 00:02:04.311
- I think we found it.

00:02:04.311 --> 00:02:05.347
This is the one.

00:02:05.347 --> 00:02:07.084
Although this one doesn't
have turtles on it,

00:02:07.084 --> 00:02:08.270
which I'm really upset about.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.009
- I'm wearing a pink
backpack in my picture.

00:02:10.009 --> 00:02:12.754
This actually, probably, is perfect.

00:02:12.754 --> 00:02:14.139
- I had these pair of boots.

00:02:14.139 --> 00:02:16.222
I wore them all the time!

00:02:17.654 --> 00:02:19.649
This is what my boots looked like.

00:02:19.649 --> 00:02:22.732
(jaunty piano music)

00:02:25.821 --> 00:02:28.154
(rap music)

00:02:32.649 --> 00:02:34.908
- [Nichole] Hey, guys, what
do you think of my outfit?

00:02:34.908 --> 00:02:36.575
Do you like my hair?

00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:38.758
- Umm...

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:48.937
- [Nichole] They're laughing at me!

00:02:48.937 --> 00:02:51.221
I don't think they like my outfit.

00:02:51.221 --> 00:02:52.971
- [Regina] Oh my God.

00:02:54.069 --> 00:02:56.588
(laughing)

00:02:56.588 --> 00:02:58.587
I look like a man.

00:02:58.587 --> 00:02:59.420
No.

00:03:10.499 --> 00:03:11.499
- Hey, Eric.

00:03:16.613 --> 00:03:18.279
- You could be on,
like, Dora the Explorer.

00:03:18.279 --> 00:03:21.565
- God, that's the best
compliment I've gotten all day!

00:03:21.565 --> 00:03:23.006
Swiper, no swiping!

00:03:23.006 --> 00:03:24.507
- Oh man!

00:03:24.507 --> 00:03:25.885
- Some people didn't notice any difference

00:03:25.885 --> 00:03:29.080
in what I was wearing, which
is actually kinda funny.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.438
- So basically, everyone hated the boots.

00:03:31.438 --> 00:03:33.161
It looked really cute back then.

00:03:33.161 --> 00:03:35.475
I don't know if it looks cute now.

00:03:35.475 --> 00:03:38.418
- There's this little girl on
her actual first day of school

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:42.225
and she looked up at me
and then looked at her mom,

00:03:42.225 --> 00:03:44.168
and then looked back at me, like,

00:03:44.168 --> 00:03:46.049
"What is this girl wearing?"

00:03:46.049 --> 00:03:47.118
She had a really cool backpack, though,

00:03:47.118 --> 00:03:48.827
I was kinda jealous, to be honest.

00:03:48.827 --> 00:03:52.760
- If I had to go back and change
anything about my wardrobe,

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:54.524
I don't think I would.

00:03:54.524 --> 00:03:57.816
Even though it was not a good look,

00:03:57.816 --> 00:03:58.856
that's who I was.

00:03:58.856 --> 00:04:03.487
I was awkward and weird and
I didn't know how to smile,

00:04:03.487 --> 00:04:07.569
but that's who I was, so I
wouldn't change anything.

00:04:07.569 --> 00:04:10.236
(upbeat music)

